;B[pl]CR[pl]LB[fo:A]C[Black should try to get sente to play at A. ];W[nc]CR[nc]
;B[qf]CR[qf]LB[pf:A][ne:B]C[This move is not a bad move, we see it very 
often in the professional's games. But to avoid 
the white moyo becomes too big, I think it is better for 
black to play higher at A. 

Later white has a beautiful move at B.]
;W[no]CR[no];B[nq]CR[nq];W[lo]CR[lo]MA[jj]C[If white wants to make the marked stone 
